msgid "Virtual Images (add/remove associations)"
msgstr "Virtual Images (Verknüpfungen hinzufügen/entfernen)"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:86
msgid "Tenant Permissions"
msgstr "Tenant Permissions"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:90
#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:100
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:90
msgid ""
"License Type, License Key, Org Name, and Full Name cannot be modified "
"after creation. To change these values, delete and recreate the license."
msgstr "License Type, License Key, Org Name und Full Name können nach der Erstellung nicht geändert werden. Um diese Werte zu ändern, löschen und erstellen Sie die Lizenz neu."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:93
msgid "Deleting a License"
msgstr "Eine Lizenz löschen"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:97
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Delete`"
msgstr "Wählen Sie :guilabel:`Delete`"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:98
msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr "Löschen bestätigen"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:100
msgid ""
"Deleting a license does not deactivate software on existing Instances. It"
" only prevents future automatic application during provisioning."
msgstr "Das Löschen einer Lizenz deaktiviert Software auf vorhandenen Instanzen nicht. Es verhindert nur die zukünftige automatische Anwendung während der Provisionierung."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:103
msgid "Virtual Image Association"
msgstr "Virtual-Image-Verknüpfung"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:105
msgid "Virtual Images are the link between licenses and provisioning:"
msgstr "Virtual Images sind die Verbindung zwischen Lizenzen und Provisionierung:"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:107
msgid "A single Virtual Image can be associated with one license"
msgstr "Ein einzelnes Virtual Image kann mit einer Lizenz verknüpft werden"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:108
msgid "A single license can be associated with multiple Virtual Images"
msgstr "Eine einzelne Lizenz kann mit mehreren Virtual Images verknüpft werden"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:109
msgid ""
"Virtual Images are managed in :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`"
" (Library > Virtual Images)"
msgstr "Virtual Images werden in :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` verwaltet (Library > Virtual Images)"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:110
msgid "Images synced from Clouds are available for license association"
msgstr "Von Clouds synchronisierte Images stehen für die Lizenzverknüpfung zur Verfügung"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:112
msgid "To add a Virtual Image to a license:"
msgstr "So fügen Sie ein Virtual Image zu einer Lizenz hinzu:"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:114
msgid "Edit the license"
msgstr "Bearbeiten Sie die Lizenz"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:115
msgid "In the **VIRTUAL IMAGES** field, search by name"
msgstr "Im Feld **VIRTUAL IMAGES** nach Namen suchen"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:116
msgid "Select the image from the results"
msgstr "Das Image aus den Ergebnissen auswählen"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:117
msgid "Save the license"
msgstr "Die Lizenz speichern"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:120
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:122
msgid "Licenses can be managed via the |morpheus| API:"
msgstr "Lizenzen können über die |morpheus|-API verwaltet werden:"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/licenses.rst:124
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# List licenses\n"
"curl \"$MORPHEUS_API_URL/api/provisioning-licenses\" \\\n"
"  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $MORPHEUS_API_TOKEN\"\n"
"\n"
"# Create a license\n"
"curl -X POST \"$MORPHEUS_API_URL/api/provisioning-licenses\" \\\n"
"  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $MORPHEUS_API_TOKEN\" \\\n"
"  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"  -d '{\n"
"    \"license\": {\n"
"      \"licenseType\": \"win\",\n"
"      \"name\": \"Windows Server 2022 Datacenter\",\n"
"      \"licenseKey\": \"XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX-XXXXX\",\n"
"      \"licenseVersion\": \"2022\",\n"
"      \"copies\": 50,\n"
"      \"description\": \"Datacenter license for production\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }'"
msgstr ""

